 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "The Imperial Maiden"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ko": "제국의 시녀"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "\"Common features, the illegitimate child of a self-proclaimed author.\"\n \nLeona, a maid who rose to power with her exceptional intelligence despite lacking a prestigious background.\n \nBut when the empire, which she thought would be eternal, crumbled under the enemy's invasion, she too met her death by the enemy's sword.\n \nA life filled with greed, harming others, and engaging in cunning schemes.\nHer life was filled with regret, so death was welcome...\n \nBut she returned.\nBack to the time when she first entered the palace as a maid.\n \nThis is definitely a chance to correct the mistakes of her past life.\n \n\"This time, I will live a life of protecting and nurturing, not harming and taking from others.\"\n \nChoosing the Crown Prince, her political enemy from her past life whom she had dethroned, as the key to changing this life, she served as a maid, and everything seemed to be going well...\n \n\"Leona, let's leave this place together.\"\n \nSomething seems wrong.\n \nThe secrets of the Crown Prince, who she thought was cold and indifferent, and the truth hidden from the world are revealed, and the shadow of destruction falls upon the empire.\n\n(Source: MangaUpdates)"
  },
